  "notes": "Surmai self-hosted trip planner built on Mantine. Muted slate-blue (#6b7a99) is the single brand color: sidebar rail fill, primary buttons, icons, links. Booking cards read like one-row label-over-value tables (small gray label above black value) with a large thin-line transport glyph at left and a ⋯ menu top right; flight card has an attachment footer row. Airport codes have tiny info icons revealing airport name + timezone pill on hover. Sidebar and footer are position:fixed so in the full-page capture they only cover the first 900px and the footer overlaps the 4th card. Collapsed accordion headers use #f8f9fa fill; expanded one turns white. Empty sub-sections (Rentals, Parking) are plain outlined boxes with gray text."
